{
    "title": "Kids Cooking Games 2 year olds",
    "description": "Raise a junior chef with Bimi Boo\u2019s Kids Cooking Game!\r\n\r\nThis game is perfect for kids aged 2-5 and offers a unique blend of simulator games, food games, and kids cooking games that will have your child feeling like a kids chef playing & learning new things.\r\n\r\nGame features:\r\n\r\n- 8 restaurants to play \r\n- 60+ recipes to match different tastes and preferences\r\n- No ads while playing\r\n- Safe game experience for children\r\n- Educational content in each mini game\r\n- Internet required \r\n\r\nChoose a recipe and start cooking! \r\n\r\nWith over 60 different dishes to cook in styles ranging from bakery to sushi, from pizza to healthy food, from tropic to gourmet cuisine, and even extreme cuisine where imagination starts, your kids will never run out of ways to explore the kitchen and learn about different types of cuisine through playing this game. \r\n\r\n10 unique mechanics in this cooking games for kids\r\n\r\nAll dishes are cooked differently and have steps in cooking. These steps may be in a different sequence and of different type, depending on the dish being prepared. Your child will play and learn how to make shapes, layers and many other things.\r\n\r\nEducational games for kids\r\n\r\nThe wide variety of dishes in this game will help your child develop their creativity and imagination as they play and learn to experiment with new food ingredients and flavors. As your kid cooks different dishes, the BimiBoo characters will react in different ways and display different emojis under the dishes to show their preference. This will help your child learn about different tastes and how to create dishes that are delicious and appealing to different people.\r\n\r\nKids kitchen & restaurant\r\n\r\nThe game features 8 restaurants on different topics, each with its own unique cuisine. The junior chef chooses which character to feed and learn about the taste preferences of the Bimi Boo characters. As the game progresses, the player will learn about healthy food & eating, will develop logic and mindfulness, and have a blast doing it.\r\n\r\nLet your child explore kitchen and cooking with Kids Cooking Game! With its fun and interactive gameplay, your kid will be entertained for hours while developing healthy eating habits, logic and mindfulness. Give your child the gift of cooking today with Bimi Boo's Kids Cooking Game!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Raise a junior chef with Bimi Boo\u2019s Kids Cooking Game!<br><br>This game is perfect for kids aged 2-5 and offers a unique blend of simulator games, food games, and kids cooking games that will have your child feeling like a kids chef playing &amp; learning new things.<br><br>Game features:<br><br>- 8 restaurants to play <br>- 60+ recipes to match different tastes and preferences<br>- No ads while playing<br>- Safe game experience for children<br>- Educational content in each mini game<br>- Internet required <br><br>Choose a recipe and start cooking! <br><br>With over 60 different dishes to cook in styles ranging from bakery to sushi, from pizza to healthy food, from tropic to gourmet cuisine, and even extreme cuisine where imagination starts, your kids will never run out of ways to explore the kitchen and learn about different types of cuisine through playing this game. <br><br>10 unique mechanics in this cooking games for kids<br><br>All dishes are cooked differently and have steps in cooking. These steps may be in a different sequence and of different type, depending on the dish being prepared. Your child will play and learn how to make shapes, layers and many other things.<br><br>Educational games for kids<br><br>The wide variety of dishes in this game will help your child develop their creativity and imagination as they play and learn to experiment with new food ingredients and flavors. As your kid cooks different dishes, the BimiBoo characters will react in different ways and display different emojis under the dishes to show their preference. This will help your child learn about different tastes and how to create dishes that are delicious and appealing to different people.<br><br>Kids kitchen &amp; restaurant<br><br>The game features 8 restaurants on different topics, each with its own unique cuisine. The junior chef chooses which character to feed and learn about the taste preferences of the Bimi Boo characters. As the game progresses, the player will learn about healthy food &amp; eating, will develop logic and mindfulness, and have a blast doing it.<br><br>Let your child explore kitchen and cooking with Kids Cooking Game! With its fun and interactive gameplay, your kid will be entertained for hours while developing healthy eating habits, logic and mindfulness. Give your child the gift of cooking today with Bimi Boo&#39;s Kids Cooking Game!",
